{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19mini_level_act19mini_st01","groupId":"act19mini","stageId":null,"title":"胡君","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st01.txt","sourceHash":"c9c21e2309f2724553a680e63e4089beb1916357d5a2632aaac2860af2c4264b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是家不大的茶館，原本就不算高的房屋被分出二層的格局。\n屋裡陳設簡潔，大堂中不多不少，十套供六人落座的木桌椅被擺放得整整齊齊，桌上的茶漬都被盡可能地抹去，足以證明這裡的主人有多勤勉。\n茶館的跑堂把一瓢又一瓢的水灑在地上，用拖布將屋裡的每一塊青石板擦得透亮。\n茶館看似許久沒有迎來客人，也不知是什麼樣的客人值得這樣的禮遇。\n緊接著，客人就從門外來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二……兩位客官裡面請，請問要先上一壺茶嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不急，我先問你——這座小鎮是不是叫邙山鎮？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座小鎮是叫邙山鎮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這家茶館的掌櫃，還是跑堂？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是跑堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃不在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還真的是問什麼答什麼，蠻老實的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那我再問你，今日你們這家茶館裡，有沒有來過面生的外地客人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"何時來的？是什麼模樣的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時來的，兩個人，都是劫匪模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎國粗口*，我看你是存心消遣我們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"粗魯的男人惱怒不已，狠狠一巴掌落在跑堂的臉上，將他打得摔倒在地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而那名跑堂卻不怒不惱，緩緩從地上爬起，又站在二人面前，全當無事發生一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位客人真奇怪，不喝茶也不喝酒，我可不會招待了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"老二，別難為人家小兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"去廚房看看還有沒有別的人，順便把後面所有門都關好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，茶當然是要喝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇悍的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"只是要在這裡等一位客人，等她一起喝才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不一會功夫，門外果然又來了一位客人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女剛踏進屋子，還沒等她環顧四周，弩箭和刀就分別抵在了她的後背和脖子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧了，這不是陸家兄弟嗎，真沒想到在這裡還能遇到你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你想得到，應該就不會來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不過既然遇到了，就別走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"跑堂的小兄弟。麻煩去將門關上，再掛上打烊的牌子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，再給我們上一壺茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茶上來了，幾位慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中原武林大名鼎鼎的“風雲三刀”請我喝茶，我的面子還真不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，現在只剩兩個人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天前，姑娘用那本秘笈栽贓我們兄弟三人。害我們被三大幫派外加玉門守軍，總共上百號人追殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兩人活著逃了，三弟卻死在了百灶城外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……我們兩人怎麼樣都該請姑娘喝一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……兩位大俠還活著，確實是件值得慶賀的事。那不如我以茶代酒，敬二位一杯，然後我們就好聚好散怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸二","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你還敢說——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想說廢話——那本秘笈還在你的身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你們是已經截獲了交易的消息，才趕來在這家茶館等我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那本來要出現在這裡的蒲先生呢？該不會被你們殺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不必問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……看來無論如何，你們都是鐵了心要拿到這本秘笈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"已經被姑娘栽贓過一次，今日要是拿不到那本秘笈，我們被白白冤枉一次，三弟的死也沒有交代了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我反而想問問，兩位大俠真的清楚我手裡這本秘笈是什麼來路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"傳聞中玉門那位武功已經出神入化的宗師，退隱江湖前將畢生武學都寫在一本書裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是在不久前，這本書才流入了民間，但見過其真容的人寥寥無幾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兄弟也是多方打聽，最可靠的消息是，那本書就在你這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩位想要這本秘笈，自然也是想要練成絕世武功，去爭天下第一的囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是就算武功大成又能怎麼樣？是能在武林裡作威作福，還是能為你們死去的兄弟復仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，在成為天下第一之前，你們兄弟兩人就要先爭個你死我活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我的耐心不多——交出東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人說著，又把玩了一下手中的刀。\n少女見狀，看似無奈地搖頭嘆氣，從隨身的行囊中拿出一個小包裹，方正的輪廓正是一本書的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了罷了，這本書對我來說本來就沒用，反正都是要賣掉的，賣給誰都差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼兩位出什麼價呢？姑且一提，這本書的上一位買家，出價不低哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女說著，用手比劃了一個“七”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個更好的價格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……閣下這樣做生意不是很講理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，這已經是相當公道的價格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到的消息沒錯的話，那位宗師應該是把這本秘笈留給了玉門的守城大將。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道姑娘是怎麼拿到手的，但應該也不可能是什麼正當手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是匪，閣下是賊。我們各行各的道，談不上多公正，也談不上不公正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個人真是無趣……好吧好吧，就當作我這次徹底輸了一次吧。東西已經在你手裡了，現在我可以走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"……還是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個粗人，但“懷璧其罪”的道理還是懂的，要是讓你把消息傳到江湖上，恐怕我們活不到練成秘笈中武功的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伶俐的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你們勤快點，再聰明點……說不定呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你剩下的廢話，可以留到下輩子再講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"要是還有下輩子，記得一個道理——不要玩火自焚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人難以置信地看著掉落在地上的刀。\n他在江湖上摸爬滾打多年，向來把手中的刀握得很穩。\n但他現在卻拿不動這把刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸二","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……大……哥……不好……這茶裡……有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸二","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……下的……藥……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我下的藥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"茶館跑堂沉默地忙碌著，他不知從哪裡找來一捆麻繩，不一會功夫便將三個中了毒、手腳無力的人捆得如同粽子般，整整齊齊擺放在牆角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"將閣下錯認作茶館跑堂，的確是我眼瞎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下下毒的手段如此高明，也是個老江湖吧？還請留下姓名，讓我們死也死個明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館跑堂","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有看錯，我就是一個茶館跑堂，不是老江湖。認識我的朋友，叫我“胡君”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那閣下應該也認識蒲先生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就是我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能再容我多問一句，閣下要這本書，又是為何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這座小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座小鎮，總共是五百二十戶人家，繞著走上一圈，共兩千九百步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多年過去了，兩個數字一點也沒變，我不願再留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要離開，就必須有些變化。想要變化，就必須拿到這本秘笈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不懂閣下在打什麼機鋒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不明白也無妨，這世上的事，本來就不是樁樁件件都能讓人明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好，說的不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陸大","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"今天栽在你手裡，我認了！要殺要剮，來個痛快就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們今天是栽在了我手裡，認不認都是無所謂的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文弱的少年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生既然已經得到了自己想要的東西，又何苦再害人性命呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人？什麼時候坐在這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下名叫雲青萍，只是旅遊路過此處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實在下從中午就坐在這裡，只是閣下眼中都是那本秘笈，自然就看不到我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡君見到角落裡站起的那人，立刻握緊了手中的尖刀，思索片刻後，又放鬆下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒必要怕你，茶館裡的水都被我下了藥，你應該也中毒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是閣下本來也沒有必要怕我啊，在下只是一個手無縛羽之力的書生，無論如何都沒有辦法與閣下動手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你卻想要救這幾個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。我想要勸閣下高抬貴手，不要再造殺業了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾個人，不是好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果剛才是他拿到了秘笈，他同樣會殺了旁人滅口——他剛剛親口這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這幾位的確是作惡多端，但閣下應該還是個秉性善良的人吧。那又何苦為他們賠了自己的清白呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要閣下將這幾人交給官府，自然會有人處罰他們的罪行，至於那本秘笈的事，在下也保證會守口如瓶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下覺得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說話和我的朋友很像，他是個好人，你應該也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我暫時無法相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會殺你，取而代之的是，現在請你自己走過來，綁上這根繩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下想要避免麻煩，麻煩卻還是找上了門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要吵鬧，不然你們四個人，一個都活不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（配合地點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，這家茶館打烊了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"青硯小姨：\n\\n\\n展信佳。\n\\n\\n我已聽說小姨此前辭職之事，我雖不瞭解其中細節，但這般勇氣之舉，我深感佩服。不怪母親常提起讓我以小姨為榜樣。\n\\n\\n閒言少敘，此次致函，是有要事相託。\n\\n\\n我有一名故友，名為雲青萍，此番與我一同來到百灶。這幾日本該去往司歲台述職。然而三日前，他卻失蹤了。\n我的這位朋友向來持重，這次不告而別十分不尋常，恐有意外。\n\\n\\n從我找到的線索來看，他最後的動向應該是從北面出城，往邙山的方向去了，應該與小姨回天師府的方向相同。\n我本想自己去尋找，但司歲台近日責任繁重，外加聽聞父親軍營中又有變故，實在難以脫身。\n\\n\\n所以只能拜託小姨協助尋找我這位朋友的下落。我已在信中附上這位朋友的照片，如若小姨找到他的下落，還請儘快聯絡我。\n\\n\\n晚輩左樂拜上\n祝\n\\n\\n身體健康，休假愉快。\n\\n\\n另，下回家宴，請小姨一定賞光，父親和母親一定很想聽聽小姨辭職的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"narration","text":"半日前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個小子，倒是學會指派任務給我了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼叫勇氣之舉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒大沒小……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知不覺間，麟青硯已經走入了這座陌生的小鎮。\n這是一座古樸的小鎮，低矮的房屋錯落有致，路上少有行人，盡是一片靜謐祥和的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邙山腳下，原來有這樣的一座小鎮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有點奇怪，進了小鎮就開始沒有訊號了，天師府附近竟然還有連訊號基站都沒有安裝的小鎮……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，姑娘——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，姑娘——沒見過你，從鎮外來的嗎？稀罕，真稀罕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……這座小鎮很少有外人來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前很少，最近倒很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想來也是，這個小鎮的入口很隱蔽，在地圖上也沒有標記……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩請問一下，你是否知道去天師府的路怎麼走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師府，天師府——沒聽過，沒聽過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那請問，出鎮的路是哪一條？進來的時候沒特別注意，現在回頭連原路都找不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出鎮，出鎮——我也沒出過，不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，別急——吃個烤餅，慢慢逛。凡事講火候，急不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是住在這座小鎮的人？你在這裡住了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我——是的。從第一把火燒熱了我的肚子開始，就一直在這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火燒肚子……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……謝了，我再找看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，姑娘——剛出爐的烤餅，來一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我不餓……剛出爐的烤餅，指的是從懷裡拿出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火候到了，便是到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好燙！把這麼燙的東西直接藏在胸口——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笑盈盈的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急不得，急不得。姑娘的火候，自己再找找吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八千九百九十一，八千九百九十二，八千……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！你沒事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一位埋頭走路的少女一頭撞上了路過的麟青硯，就這麽一屁股摔倒在地，懷裡的東西掉了滿地。\n麟青硯連忙去看她的情況，再抬頭去找時，那位送她餅的老翁已不見蹤影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傘，我的傘……先生說，傘不可離手……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你。還有一個信封，從你袖子裡掉出來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女慌忙接過傘撐起來，並單手艱難地把信封塞回袖子裡。\n麟青硯抬頭看了一眼晴朗的天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，先站起來吧，我來扶你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這姑娘的身體，好輕……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛數到幾了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，八千九百九十三？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八千九百九十四，八千九百九十五……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，你還好嗎？要我送你回家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去？我不能回去，我和他約好了在豆腐鋪見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……糟糕，他說這是秘密，性命攸關，打死也不能說出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到了嗎？聽到我要去豆腐鋪和他見面的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是你的私事，我可以當作沒聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我才不想被打死——我又數到幾了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……八千九百九十六？你在數什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去和他見面的時間，他說數到九千的時候——啊，我又說出來了，我要被打死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒理解錯的話，炎國話的“打死也不能”一般只是誇張的說法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，姑娘你感覺到性命受到威脅——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八千九百九十七，八千九百九十八……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八千九百九十九，九千！時間到了，我去見面啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座小鎮裡的人，他們的行為看起來有點奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是？這封信……是剛才從她信封裡掉出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“機密要聞，勿轉他人手”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，姑娘！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君，胡君——我來和你見面啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓，小點聲。來這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君。你為什麼讓我數到九千才來找你，數得我嘴皮都快破了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就只會用這種辦法算時間，我也沒有別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來的時候有人看見你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到的人不少，但他們都不知道我是來見你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西弄到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生的抽屜，第二格，沒錯。上面寫著，“機密要聞，勿轉他人手”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用多說，把信給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，我的信……信不見了，應該是來的路上弄丟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是沒關係，我看過信裡的內容，裡面寫了“未時三刻，老茶館交易”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你偷看了信裡的內容，還弄丟了信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君，你怎麼了？眉頭都皺在一起了，看起來好兇，我不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看清楚了？信上的時間，寫的是未時三刻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊！雖然我不會看時間，但我的記性很好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君，你怎麼又不說話了？還要我再數到九千你才肯理我嗎？好吧，一，二，三，四，五……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君，胡君——你這樣子，我真的很不喜歡。你的臉色，好可怕哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小舒，我很信任你。如果事情順利結束，我本來打算帶你一起離開，我們可以一起離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還沒有做好準備，你還沒有學會保密。所以我不能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到，胡君你的眼睛濕了。你很難過，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生說，東西濕掉的時候，我不能幫忙擦，但是可以幫忙吹吹。你的眼睛，乾一點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"打傘的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你把我的手抓得太緊了，手被你捏皺啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，小舒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是朝這個方向走的，怎麼這麼快就不見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說和人約在了豆腐鋪，應該是在——啊，看到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔著一條小巷，麟青硯遠遠望見了方才遇到的少女打著的傘。\n麟青硯快步上前，想要歸還少女遺失的信件，直到她靠近時才看清楚——\n傘孤零零地掉在地上，少女卻不知所蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客官裡面請，隨便坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才在門外看到，這裡已經掛上了打烊的牌子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有客人喝茶，就不能算打烊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先幫客官您上一壺茶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"桌上的綠茶香氣撲鼻，麟青硯伸出的手卻又停下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是這座茶館的夥計？是否方便向你打聽幾件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人儘管問，我知無不答就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見這家茶館開在這座小鎮最繁華的地方，怎麼早早就掛上了打烊的牌子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要視情況而定，也不是每時每刻都有人想要喝茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這裡的客人，也不一定要喝茶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時有客人需要避雨歇腳，也是可以進來坐一會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝不喝茶都無妨，但不喝茶還要找事的話，那就萬萬不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的也是……那我倒是有些好奇，今天這家茶館營業的時候，你有沒有見到過這樣找麻煩的客人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天來的客人，都是喝了茶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我從剛才就注意到，你衣服前襟上，好像有一點剛沾上去的顏料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是茶館的夥計，又不是畫坊的先生，你又能去哪裡沾染到這種顏料呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這個顏色的顏料，我今天恰好在一把傘上見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來好像很著急的樣子。為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時間……未時三刻的交易，此時應該早已談完了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡君當機立斷，立刻掀翻了面前的桌子。桌子擋住了麟青硯的視線，這足以讓他有機會拼命逃向二樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微弱的呼喊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救……救命……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秘笈在你手裡……那個人果然騙了我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡君","speakerId":"avg_npc_1874_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也由不得你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝麟少卿……沒想到會在這裡遇到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會認識我——等等，你是……雲青萍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經常聽左兄說起您，久仰大名——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左樂說你失蹤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失蹤？左兄難道沒有看到我留下的信？看來真是我考慮不周了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別說那麼多了，這裡到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旁邊這三位，應該是為爭搶一個寶物起了些爭端，然後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三位？哪來的三位？"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯向旁邊看去，那裡除了兩個被五花大綁的劫匪，就只剩一地斷裂的麻繩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還真是奇怪……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯匆匆趕到了茶館外的街上，已經有不少鎮民圍觀這裡的動靜。\n她聽到了那一聲撞擊聲，透過窗戶，她也看到了那個人從二樓摔落，掉落在茶館門前的大街上。\n她本以為會看到一個受傷的人，甚至是一具屍體。然而她在這裡看到的……\n只有一堆茶壺的碎片。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
